    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Meet a Customer Support Specialist\r\n\r\nMarisol is a Customer Support Lead at a financial services app. She handles the calls when the rules in your code make a user's life harder. Ask her the following questions, then any additional ones of your own.\r\n\r\n1. What did you actually work on yesterday?\r\n\r\n2. Do you use AI at work?\r\n\r\n3. Have you ever filed a ticket about a rule you thought was wrong?\r\n\r\n4. What would you tell a student curious about this kind of work?",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
